					},
					"end": {
						"line": 295,
						"column": 2,
						"offset": 3124
					}
				},
				"raw": "高斯积分：\n$$\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} e^{-x^2} dx = \\sqrt{\\pi}\n$$\n\n多行推导：\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n(a+b)^2 &= a^2 + 2ab + b^2 \\\\\n        &= (a-b)^2 + 4ab\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
			},
